+## APT Application Model
+
+| Repo type | Applicable APT packs and profiles | Required checks | Suggested examples |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| React/Vite UI app | `apt-core`, `ux-review`, `documentation`; `context/ui` | UI workflow, docs, agent instructions | `showcases/ui/intent-based-navigation.md` |
+| Cloudflare Worker / Hono API | `apt-core`, `cloudflare`, `api-review`, `documentation`; `context/cloudflare` | API, security, deployment, bindings | `showcases/cloudflare/worker-hono-structure.md`, `showcases/api/route-design.md` |
+| Documentation site | `apt-core`, `documentation`, `governance`; `context/documentation` | docs structure, setup accuracy, source-of-truth boundaries | `showcases/docs/documentation-structure.md` |
+| Payment/API gateway | `apt-core`, `payments`, `api-review`, `security`, `governance` | API, webhook, auth, idempotency, secret handling | `showcases/api/route-design.md`, `showcases/security/security-review-expectations.md` |
+| Agent/instructions repository | `apt-core`, `ai-development`, `governance`, `documentation` | agent instructions, prompts, skills, profile composition | `showcases/agents/instruction-structure.md` |
+| Mixed full-stack app | `standard` plus `ux-review`, `api-review`, `cloudflare`, `security` as applicable | repo alignment, UI, API, docs, security | UI, API, docs, and Cloudflare showcases as applicable |
+| Prototype or Lovable-generated app | `lovable`, `migration`, `documentation`, optional `cloudflare` and `modernization` | migration risk, behavior preservation, docs normalization | docs, UI, and Cloudflare showcases as applicable |
+
